        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira icumi na gatanu Kayisari Tiberiyo ari ku ngoma, Pontiyo Pilato ar’ icēgēra ciwe i Yudaya, Herode na we ar’ umwami w’i Galilaya, na Filipo mwene se ar’ umwami w’igihugu co muri Ituraya n’i Tirakoniti, na Lusaniya ar’ umwami w’i Abilene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Anasi na Kayafa ar’ abaherezi bakuru, mur’ uwo mwaka ijambo ry’Imana rishika kuri Yohana mwene Zakariya, ari mu bugaragwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.1+MAT.3.2+MAT.3.3+MAT.3.4+MAT.3.5+MAT.3.6+MAT.3.7+MAT.3.8+MAT.3.9+MAT.3.10+MAT.3.11+MAT.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3:1-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.1+MRK.1.2+MRK.1.3+MRK.1.4+MRK.1.5+MRK.1.6+MRK.1.7+MRK.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mrk 1:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aja mu gihugu cose giherereye kuri Yorodani, yigisha abantu ukubatizwa kwo kwihana ngo bakūrwekw ivyaha: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nk’uko vyanditswe mu gitabo c’amajambo y’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
